{"content":"Now I have a comprehensive picture. Let me compile all the distinct enforcement sites:\n\nh15.\n\n1. **GetMemo / checkMemoReadAccess** (shared guard for single-memo reads: GetMemo, UpdateMemo, DeleteMemo, etc.) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (line 39–67)\n2. **ListMemos** (query-level visibility filter on listing) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go` (lines 218–226)\n3. **CreateMemoComment** (checks parent memo visibility before allowing comment) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go` (line 41)\n4. **ListMemoComments** (filters visible comments by visibility) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go` (lines 157–161)\n5. **ListMemoReactions / UpsertMemoReaction** (checks memo visibility before listing or creating reactions) — `server/router/api/v1/reaction_service.go` (lines 30–41, 82–85)\n6. **ListMemoAttachments** (checks memo visibility before listing attachments) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_attachment_service.go` (lines 213–225)\n7. **GetAttachment / checkAttachmentAccess** (linked attachment access follows memo visibility) — `server/router/api/v1/attachment_service.go` (lines 255–258, 422–455)\n8. **ListMemoRelations** (filters related memos by visibility) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_relation_service.go` (lines 108–112)\n9. **batchConvertMemoRelations** (batch relation loader applies visibility filter) — `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_converter.go` (lines 182–187)\n10. **UserStats (ListAllUserStats / ListUserStats)** (restricts memo counts by visibility) — `server/router/api/v1/user_service_stats.go` (lines 84–91, 217–221)\n11. **SSE event delivery / canReceive** (private events only dispatched to creator/admin) — `server/router/api/v1/sse_hub.go` (lines 134–143)\n12. **canViewerAccessMemo (notifications)** (visibility check before generating notification content) — `server/router/api/v1/user_service_notifications.go` (lines 302–316)\n13. **canUserAccessMentionContext (mention helpers)** (visibility check before